<title>AUSTRIA: Austria NatBank sees drop in '96 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Austria NatBank sees drop in '96 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's National Bank on Thursday said pre-tax profit for 1996 was likely to fall to 11.4 billion schillings from 12.6 billion last year.</p>
<p>The central bank said it would pay 8.4 billion schillings of the total to the federal budget, compared with 9.3 billion last year.</p>
<p>The bank's total assets rose to 347.2 billion schillings from 314.9 billion a year ago. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
